# Raw Claude Code output of a run: kept locally for debugging, never part
# of the committed baseline (observed.json holds what the scoring reads).
baseline/**/claude.json
baseline/**/claude.jsonl
baseline/**/claude.stderr
# An implementation run's own logs: the runner's commands, and the copy and
# the working folder of the acceptance script. Their ends are in
# observed.json.
baseline/**/*.log
baseline/**/acceptance.sh
baseline/**/acceptance-dir/
